UPDATE `tournament_match_summaries`
SET `summary` = 'Game 1: Monkey.D.Luffy wins. Mihawk curves Kin’emon, Perona, Coffin Boat, and Samurai but chooses to starve Luffy. Luffy develops Usopp, Rodo, Saul, Nami, and Sanji without needing life cards, then uses Kong Gun to remove Mihawk’s Oden and Law. An 8-cost Luffy reanimates two-cost bodies and helps set up a 12k Robin attack at zero life that Mihawk cannot counter.

Game 2: Dracule Mihawk wins. Luffy again develops Usopp, Saul, and Kong Gun, but Mihawk has For Fun and Trichiliocosm to survive Luffy’s final push at one life. Back-to-back 10-cost Shanks rest Luffy’s blockers and close the game for Mihawk.

Game 3: Monkey.D.Luffy wins. Luffy rebuilds his draw engine through Sanji, Gird, and Usopp, then develops 8-cost Luffy and Loki. Kong Gun clears Mihawk’s board, while Ground Death and counter cards help Luffy survive the Shanks attacks at zero life. Luffy returns on the next turn and lands the final attack, advancing from Top 16.'
WHERE `id` = 'utrecht-2026-top16-luffy-mihawk';
